Package: easydns
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), python3-dnslib (>= 0.9.19), python3-yaml (>= 6.0), adduser
Description: internal DNS server with conditional forwarding and native peering
 EasyDNS serves local forward and reverse zones, caches DNS answers and
 forwards queries to upstream resolvers. Optional authenticated native
 peering synchronizes records between nodes.
 .
 Includes a systemd service and sample configurations for hierarchical
 hub-and-branch deployments.